    "explanation_ar": "hot أقوى من warm. warm دافئ ولطيف، و hot حار جدًا.",
    "explanation_en": "\"Hot\" is stronger than \"warm\". Warm is pleasant; hot is very warm.",
    "examples": [
     {
      "word": "hot",
      "sentence": "It's 40 degrees. It's hot!"
